  "description": "Beautifully presented spotless 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom garden apartment, located in the much sought after gated development of Rochelle on the Old Blackrock Road, just an 800m walk from the city centre.\nThis apartment offers bright contemporary living with fresh neutral decor and stylish modern flooring throughout.  \n\nThe spacious open plan living and dining area enjoys excellent natural light and opens directly onto a private patio area.  \n\nThe kitchen is fully equipped with dishwasher,  washer/dryer, fridge freezer, oven, hob, microwave, airfryer, crockery and utensils.  \n\nThe ensuite bedroom has two new single beds and fitted wardrobes.\nThe second bedroom has one new 5 foot bed with fitted wardrobes. \nThere are storage units in the hallway and in the living area.\nThe apartment has Virgin Media Broadband. \nHeating is Gas fired central heating. \nBin collection is included in the rent.  \nResidents benefit from a designated car parking space.\nPets or smoking are not permitted. \nPlease email with details of proposed tenant(s) and viewings will be arranged as soon as possible.",
